'''Protection Prayers''' are often used to refer to the three [[Prayer#Prayers|''"Protect from x"'' Prayers]] that could nullify or mitigate damage from incoming attacks of the respective [[combat style]] or discipline from monsters or players. These are available in both [[free-to-play]] and [[pay-to-play]].

