Only one protection prayer can be activated at a time; activating a different protection Prayer will deactivate the current one. '''Protection Prayers only provide a 40% damage reduction in [[PVP]].'''  Protection prayers block all damage in most circumstances against [[Non-player character|NPCs]], though some [[boss]]es (typically high-levelled) have attacks that can deal partial or full damage through them. 

When an attack fully ignores protection prayers, it's known as being "[[typeless]]". Most typeless attacks are used by NPCs, though there are some that can be used by the player. 

Several monsters are able to make use of protection prayers as well.
