==Trivia==
* The [[Kalphite Queen]], in [[2004]], was the first monster to use simultaneous protection prayers, with her first form using Protect from Magic and Missiles simultaneously. [[File:Protect from Magic and Missiles overhead.png]] However, this did not grant her true immunity, instead only representing her increased defence against those styles.
** The [[Judge of Yama (A Kingdom Divided)|Judge of Yama]], encountered during [[A Kingdom Divided]] in [[2021]], was the first monster to use true full-immunity simultaneous prayers. This reflected a shift in Jagex' design philosophy, as similar prayers became a key mechanic in future high-level combat encounters.

